  "Function": {
    "Reasoning": "The user wants to filter the 'goal' list based on the property 'GoalSteps.LineNumber' matching the value %request.body.lineNumber%, then extract the parent object of the matched item, and retrieve the first such item to store in %step%. The FilterOnPropertyAndValue function supports filtering by property and value, extracting a specific property (parent), and retrieving one item (first).",
